Third-party components and references
-------------------------------------

1. mymc+ — https://git.sr.ht/~thestr4ng3r/mymcplus
   Copyright (C) Florian Märkl, based on mymc by Ross Ridge.
   Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.

   The LZARI decompressor, the PS2 memory card layout (superblock, FAT,
   directory entries, ECC) and the MAX Drive container parser in this project
   were written with reference to mymc+ and are therefore distributed under
   the same license.  Affected files:

       Sources/Core/LZARI.swift
       Sources/Core/PS2ECC.swift
       Sources/Core/MemoryCard.swift
       Sources/Core/MaxSave.swift

2. LZARI algorithm — Haruhiko Okumura (1989).
   The .max container used by Datel MAX Drive compresses its payload with
   LZARI (arithmetic coding + LZSS).  The decoder follows that published
   algorithm.

